OL,3,AHoly Cross school dispute was 'hatred
OL,4,Aat its worst'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe priest who helped shield
OL,7,Fschoolgirls during the 2001 Holy Cross
OL,8,Fdispute has said the "hurt" of that
OL,9,Fordeal could happen again.
OL,11,FSpeaking on the 25th anniversary of
OL,12,FHoly Cross, Fr Aidan Troy said that
OL,13,Fpossibility is what keeps him "devoted
OL,14,Fto dialogue, to conversation, to
OL,15,Fsearching for justice and to caring
OL,16,Fabout people".
OL,18,FFr Aidan said the sectarian dispute was
OL,19,F"hatred at its worst".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
