OL,3,AHoly Cross school dispute was 'hatred
OL,4,Aat its worst'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt happened in north Belfast when
OL,7,Floyalist protesters tried to block the
OL,8,Froute taken by Holy Cross school pupils
OL,9,Fand their parents, who were from a
OL,10,FCatholic background, on their walk to
OL,11,Fclass.
